{"id":"457620","name":"梨子银耳汤","author":"敏zhu","authorId":"9037209","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/457620/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"雪花梨","amount":"一个"},{"name":"银耳","amount":"半朵"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄冰糖","amount":"一块"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"银耳提前泡发。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/2019050915573705694109037209.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡好的银耳，撕成小朵，放入砂锅加入适量的清水。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/2019050915573706265019037209.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"大火烧开后转最小火，炖煮四十分钟，银耳软糯。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/2019050915573706873249037209.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"梨子去皮去核，切小块。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/2019050915573707193679037209.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"银耳软糯后加入梨子，再煮十分钟。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/2019050915573707594919037209.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入冰糖，煮五分钟，然后关火即可。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/2019050915573708001189037209.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"好喝的梨子银耳汤就做好了。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2019/05/09/2019050915573708431569037209.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}